"0a3cd321-3e76-4622-911b-0fda2e5d6b1a\",\r\n 1164\t  \"level\": 2,\r\n 1165\t  \"file\": false,\r\n 1166\t  \"question\": \"According to the World Bank, which countries had gross savings of over 35% of GDP for every year in the period 2001-2010? Give your answer as a comma-separated list of countries in alphabetical order.\",\r\n 1167\t  \"gold\": \"Brunei, China, Morocco, Singapore\",\r\n 1168\t  \"got\": \"Brunei Darussalam, China, Kuwait, Macao, Qatar, Singapore, United Arab Emirates\",\r\n 1169\t  \"secs\": 329.8,\r\n 1170\t  \"raw_tail\": \" read {\\\"path\\\":\\\"results.json\\\",\\\"limit\\\":5}]\\n\\n[tool read {\\\"path\\\":\\\"fails.json\\\",\\\"limit\\\":5}]\\n\\n[tool read {\\\"path\\\":\\\".goathome/sessions/20260916-040133ipib.jsonl\\\"}]\\n\\n[tool computer {\\\"action\\\":\\\"launch\\\",\\\"app\\\":\\\"firefox\\\"}]\\n\\n[tool read {\\\"path\\\":\\\".goathome/sessions/20260916-111408c77u.jsonl\\\",\\\"offset\\\":60,\\\"limit\\\":20}]\\n\"\r\n 1171\t },\r\n 1172\t {\r\n 1173\t  \"task_id\": \"ed58682d-bc52-4baa-9eb0-4eb81e1edacc\",\r\n 1174\t  \"level\": 2,\r\n 1175\t  \"file\": false,\r\n 1176\t  \"question\": \"What is the last word before the second chorus of the King of Pop's fifth single from his sixth studio album?\",\r\n 1177\t  \"gold\": \"stare\",\r\n 1178\t  \"got\": \"answer\",\r\n 1179\t  \"secs\": 32.6,\r\n 1180\t  \"raw_tail\": \"ompt\\\":\\\"Find the lyrics of Human Nature by Michael Jackson with verse and chorus breakdown\\\",\\\"url\\\"]\\n\\n[tool websearch {\\\"query\\\":\\\"Human Nature Michael Jackson lyrics \\\\\\\"looking out across the morning\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n\\n[tool websearch {\\\"query\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Human Nature\\\\\\\" Michael Jackson song structure verses choruses bridge\\\"}]\\n\"\r\n 1181\t },\r\n 1182\t {\r\n 1183\t  \"task_id\": \"7cc4acfa-63fd-4acc-a1a1-e8e529e0a97f\",\r\n 1184\t  \"level\": 2,\r\n 1185\t  \"file\": true,\r\n 1186\t  \"question\": \"The attached spreadsheet contains the sales of menu items for a regional fast-food chain. Which city had the greater total sales: Wharvton or Algrimand?\",\r\n 1187\t  \"gold\": \"Wharvton\",\r\n 1188\t  \"got\": \"EXCLUDED: timed out after repeated attempts\",\r\n 1189\t  \"secs\": 0,\r\n 1190\t  \"raw_tail\": \"excluded\"\r\n 1191\t },\r\n 1192\t {\r\n 1193\t  \"task_id\": \"65afbc8a-89ca-4ad5-8d62-355bb401f61d\",\r\n 1194\t  \"level\": 1,\r\n 1195\t  \"file\": true,\r\n 1196\t  \"question\": \"You are given this Excel file as a map. You start on the START cell and move toward the END cell. You are allowed to move two cells per turn, and you may move up, down, left, or right. You may not mov\",\r\n 1197\t  \"gold\": \"F478A7\",\r\n 1198\t  \"got\": \"EXCLUDED: timed out after repeated attempts\",\r\n 1199\t  \"secs\": 0,\r\n 1200\t  \"raw_tail\": \"excluded\"\r\n 1201\t },\r\n 1202\t {\r\n 1203\t  \"task_id\": \"f2feb6a4-363c-4c09-a804-0db564eafd68\",\r\n 1204\t  \"level\": 2,\r\n 1205\t  \"file\": false,\r\n 1206\t  \"question\": \"I\\u2019m thinking about selling my home, so I want to learn more about how homes in my area sold recently. I live in Pearl City, Hawaii, which is on the island of Oahu. I know two homes near me that sold i\",\r\n 1207\t  \"gold\": \"900000\",\r\n 1208\t  \"got\": \"EXCLUDED: timed out after repeated attempts\",\r\n 1209\t  \"secs\": 0,\r\n 1210\t  \"raw_tail\": \"excluded\"\r\n 1211\t },\r\n 1212\t {\r\n 1213\t  \"task_id\": \"851e570a-e3de-4d84-bcfa-cc85578baa59\",\r\n 1214\t  \"level\": 3,\r\n 1215\t  \"file\": false,\r\n 1216\t  \"question\": \"I thought we could try a fun word puzzle together :)\\n\\nI've got a Boggle board here:\\n\\nABRL\\nEITE\\nIONS\\nFPEI\\n\\nI'd like to know the longest word that can be generated from the board. Please find the longes\",\r\n 1217\t  \"gold\": \"Briniest\",\r\n 1218\t  \"got\": \"EXCLUDED: timed out after repeated attempts\",\r\n 1219\t  \"secs\": 0,\r\n 1220\t  \"raw_tail\": \"excluded\"\r\n 1221\t },\r\n 1222\t {\r\n 1223\t  \"task_id\": \"50f58759-7bd6-4